# §12 Round-4 audit P0-1: pin operator scripts to LF so a Windows
# clone with core.autocrlf=true does NOT rewrite them to CRLF on
# checkout. This makes any `cp -a` / `git worktree`-based handoff
# safe. The handoff tarball is separately built via `git archive`
# which reads blobs directly from the index (always LF), bypassing
# working-tree normalization entirely.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
